		PRINTFORMDL %BREAKENG(@"Strangely, the running water makes no sound, and despite the ripples in its surface, the edges of the bowl aren't wet. In fact, when you try touching it, you feel only a dry, icy chill in your fingertips. Although the water distorts around your fingers, it doesn't feel like you're really touching anything at all. The bottom of the fountain's bowl is bone dry.")%
