		PRINTFORMDL %BREAKENG(@"There's a long, empty balcony sticking out from the second floor above. The door leading to it from the house is boarded up like everything else.")%
	CASE "window","windows"
		PRINTFORMDL %BREAKENG(@"Almost every window you can see has been cracked or shattered, with no attempt made at repair. The glass is sharp, so it would be dangerous to try and climb through.")%
		PRINTL
		PRINTFORMDL %BREAKENG(@"The inside of the house is completely dark. You can't see a thing from outside.")%
