				LOCALS '= "Kutaka"
			ELSE
				LOCALS '= "a winged girl"
			ENDIF
			PRINTFORMDL %BREAKENG(@"Although she looks like %LOCALS%, there's no intelligence in the chicken's eyes. She glares at you like a simple animal, seemingly unaffected by the moonlight, but still not minding that she isn't wearing any clothes.")%
			PRINTL
			PRINTFORMDL %BREAKENG(@"She clutches her stomach with a miserable expression, and you notice that unlike the cow, she has nothing to eat in her empty corner. No matter how she shifts in her nest, she doesn't make a sound nor disturb a single straw.")%
		ENDIF
